# ── BUILDS-RETENTION LANE (BH-7437, BH-7931) ────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 04:27Z on every box: each box retains its own builds/. Moves
# settled build-dir groups from builds/ to builds-archive/<YYYYMM>/<dir>, one
# index row per dir in builds-archive/index.tsv. Rule 1: merged groups older
# than builds_retention.window_days (14). Rule 2: unmerged groups older than
# builds_retention.settled_window_days (30) whose ticket is closed, or that are
# superseded or all-terminal. Lists only while the settings row
# builds_retention.dry_run is 1 (the seed): logs/builds-retention-dryrun.txt.
# One line per run in logs/builds-retention.log. Runs under nice/ionice.
# Off: flags/lane-off-builds-retention (bin/harness-ctl.sh off builds-retention).
27 4 * * * /root/harness/bin/builds-retention.sh >> /root/harness/logs/builds-retention-cron.log 2>&1
# @box hub
# @hub-lanes
27 4 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/builds-retention.sh >> /root/harness/logs/builds-retention-cron.log 2>&1
